WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.416
Marmalade Boy

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.442
Dakedo ki ni naru

00:00:14.586 --> 00:00:16.554
Kinou yori mo zutto...

00:00:17.956 --> 00:00:21.187
Togireta yume. ..

00:00:21.326 --> 00:00:24.818
Futari no tsuzukiga shiritai!

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:36.402
Ah, kami—sama...
jikan o... tomete yo

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:43.006
Kyou kasho...seifuku...
mada kami, kawakanai...

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:49.810
Ah, tasukete...
ribbon ga kimaranai...

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:56.587
Aitsu no yume mita sei... yo

00:00:57.496 --> 00:01:01.296
Koge—kake no toast kajitara...

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.837
Naze ka fui ni...
mune ga tokimeita...

00:01:10.676 --> 00:01:15.579
Amakute nigai. . .marmalade

00:01:15.714 --> 00:01:18.148
Dakara ki ni naru...

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Konna kimochi wa naze?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Ima ichiban...

00:01:25.424 --> 00:01:28.951
Aitsu no egao ni aitai!

00:02:41.533 --> 00:02:49.463
MOONLIGHT DECISION —
"YUU, DON'T LEAVE ME ALONE!"

00:06:13.912 --> 00:06:17.507
GRADUATION CEREMONY

00:12:04.028 --> 00:12:05.859
MARMALADE BOY

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:15.398
MARMALADE BOY

00:16:30.027 --> 00:16:33.963
GRADUATION PARTY

00:22:11.435 --> 00:22:12.402
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:32.857 --> 00:22:35.792
MAKING MEMORIES —
"NO MATTER WHAT HAPPENS,
I'LL HAVE NO REGRETS."

00:22:49.039 --> 00:22:57.504
Mai ochiru kareha no naka ni

00:22:57.648 --> 00:23:04.986
Kimi no sugata ga mieru made

00:23:05.122 --> 00:23:12.995
Same kaketa coffee cup

00:23:13.664 --> 00:23:21.594
Boku wa ryoute de atatameteru

00:23:21.739 --> 00:23:24.833
I 'm waiting for you, girl

00:23:24.975 --> 00:23:30.538
Umarete kara zutto
kono hi 0

00:23:30.681 --> 00:23:37.450
Matte ita kiga suru yo

00:23:37.655 --> 00:23:40.522
Just waiting for your love

00:23:40.658 --> 00:23:46.563
Jidai ni furi tsumoru
kimi e no

00:23:46.697 --> 00:23:53.967
Omoi ni umoretakute
